usage: expanded_evaluation.py [-h] --data-dir DATA_DIR --model-path MODEL_PATH
                              --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR [--limit LIMIT]
                              [--seed SEED] [--split {valid,test}]

Evaluate a frozen versioned A0 model without retraining or replacing its data.

options:
